  "notes": "Vendor figures from the DS-3E1318P-EI datasheet (2024-04-28, covering DS-3E1318P-EI / V2 / (B)): **16 x 10/100 Mbps PoE ports, 2 x gigabit combos**, 802.3at/af, **total PoE budget 230 W**, max power consumption 250 W (10 W idle), VLAN, PoE watchdog, 300 m long-range PoE. **230 W across sixteen ports is 14.4 W average**: seven 30 W devices fit. The **DS-3E1318P-EI/M** is a different chassis - 1 x gigabit RJ45 + 1 x gigabit combo and a **130 W** budget - and those /M figures, panel included, are what this entry carried until 2026-11-20.",
